    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθύρ-αιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (v. infr.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρα</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>before the door;</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθυραία,</span> epith. of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>, prob. (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιδία</span>) in <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.185
			</span></i>; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκάτη προθύραιε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>H.</u>
					6.2
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθύραια, τά,</span>
			<i>front doorway,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				384
			</span></i>.</div>
